  "createnuclear.ponder.reactor_io_placement.text_1": "Rod Input: Stores Heating or Cooling Rods. We need one Heating Rod (fuel) to heat the reactor, and one Cooling Rod for stability.",
  "createnuclear.ponder.reactor_io_placement.text_2": "Second Rod Input: This is why we need at least two inputs! One for the Heating Rod and one for the Cooling Rod to prevent explosions.",
  "createnuclear.ponder.reactor_io_placement.text_3": "Fluid Input: Fluid is also required to cool the reactor and ensure it does not explode.",
  "createnuclear.ponder.reactor_io_placement.text_4": "Alarm (Optional): Emits a sound when the reactor becomes unstable and risks exploding.",
  "createnuclear.ponder.reactor_io_placement.text_5": "Output: Necessary to extract generated energy. You can place multiple outputs to dispatch the total energy between them.",
